  "referenceNumber": "RUS1407",
  "remarks": "\nANALITICHESKI TSENTR KATEKHON OOO (a.k.a. KATEHON) is a think tank and website involved in the spread of propaganda and disinformation. Through articles on its website it is regularly engaged in providing support for and promoting policies and action which destabilise Ukraine and undermine and threaten its territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence.\n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
